        <item>
            <title>LocSet 1.2.0</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 19:40:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1.2</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>LocSet 1.2.0 — In-App Updates &amp; Security Enhancements</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Fixed in-app update checks and Sparkle feed resolution.</li>
                    <li>Upgraded license storage cryptography to ChaCha20Poly1305 AEAD authenticated encryption.</li>
                    <li>Enforced strict macOS code signature seal integrity validation on daemon processes.</li>
                    <li>Sandboxed Python module resolution within application bundle boundaries.</li>
                    <li>Added geographic coordinate boundary validation.</li>
                    <li>Improved iOS version parsing and error feedback.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
